6. Extend the Power model to support attack Powers

The existing Power architecture currently assumes Powers are fighter-owned.

That assumption needs to evolve.

There are now two conceptual scopes of Power:

Fighter Powers

* Jump Power
* Speed Power

Attack Powers

* Horizontal Knockback Power
* Vertical Knockback Power

Do not put attack knockback tiers on the fighter itself.

A fighter can have different attacks with different knockback Powers.

Instead, individual attack definitions should declare their attack Power tiers.

