8. Horizontal Knockback Power

Add:

Horizontal Knockback Power

There are exactly three tiers.

Use these values:

* Horizontal Knockback Power 1 → 140
* Horizontal Knockback Power 2 → 180
* Horizontal Knockback Power 3 → 220

The resolved value represents the magnitude placed into the attack definition’s horizontal knockback.

Tier descriptions can be concise:

Horizontal Knockback Power 1
