Add reusable attack-Power resolution.

The character attack data should declare Power tiers.

The runtime attack definition should still expose the final numeric:

knockback: { x, y }

because CombatSystem.applyHit(), clones, hit resolution, debug tooling, and tests already operate on normalized attack definitions.

In other words:

character data
→ declares attack Power tier(s)

